CAVEATS=["The Oct 30 vote tally (11–8) comes from a summary of Newsday reporting; the official minutes are not posted, and any amendments are unknown.","No record was found of the County Executive signing the budget or of the modified plan due Mar 15, 2026 under Res. 25-69.","The OLBR review figures ($175.5M / $88.1M) and the Oct 5 union-deal cost ($43M) come from secondary sources.","The outcome of NIFA's Oct 22 vote adopting its staff report is not in posted minutes yet.","All-funds budget totals were not found; the FY2024 result is a draft; FY2026 has not closed.","The tax-cap figures are derived on the Major Funds levy only; Nassau's filed OSC levy limit and carryover were not found."]
